	(text "System-5 CPU card Rev A (as drawn), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  CPU            THE CDP1802 AND ITS CLOCK\n  sheet 3  Control        RESET AND RUN CONTROL: CM1232, RUN ONE-SHOT, WAIT/CLEAR LATCHES, FRONT PANEL HEADER\n  sheet 4  Boot           A8-A15 LATCH, BOOT EPROM, 4K WINDOW, BOOT FLIP-FLOP AND -VMA\n  sheet 5  Flags          EF ROUTING (JP1-JP4), THE 1861 RIBBON, INTERRUPT, DMA, Q LED\n  sheet 6  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, LED\n\nRedrawn 2026-10-26 from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\nThis is the card as DRAWN. As built: IC1 is a 74LS374, and IC8B (the boot flip-flop) is reworked:\nPRE = D = VCC, CLK = ADDR15 (hardware/cpu/eagle/rev-a/rework/README.md).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ab621eb6-ee3a-50f3-805d-d5f845ba886f"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
